  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131nda ilk g\xF6z\xFCme \xE7arpan, kal\u0131n g\xF6vdeli ya\u015Fl\u0131
    bir zeytin a\u011Fac\u0131 oldu. A\u011Fac\u0131n \xFCzerine baz\u0131 kelimeler
    kaz\u0131nm\u0131\u015F. Belli belirsiz se\xE7ebildi\u011Fim bu kelimelerde a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131
    olarak {{harf}}, {{harf}}, {{harf}} harfleri var ve senin ge\xE7mi\u015Ften bug\xFCne
    ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131n ukdelerini yans\u0131t\u0131yor. Bunlardan
    bir tanesine \"...\" dersek, \"... olmak\", \"... ile olmak\" ya da \"...'da
    olmak\" istemi\u015Fsin ve gelecekte bu dile\u011Fin ger\xE7ekle\u015Fecek {{isim}}.\n\nHaftaya
    bug\xFCn yani {{gun_+7}} g\xFCn\xFC, renkli g\xF6zlerindeki hassasiyetten dolay\u0131
    s\u0131cak havalarda siyah \xE7er\xE7eveli \"{{g\xFCne\u015Fg\xF6zl\xFC\u011F\xFC}}\"
    marka g\xFCne\u015F g\xF6zl\xFC\u011F\xFC takan biriyle el s\u0131k\u0131\u015Facaks\u0131n.
    G\xF6zlerinde b\xFCy\xFCk sevin\xE7 g\xF6r\xFCyorum."
